      "content": "it doesn't feel 'psychological' though. it feels like a physical frequency, like a literal hum in my nervous system that aligns perfectly with the solar cycles i've been tracking. it's too precise to just be my imagination. if you look at the actual spike on the 17th, you'll see it's not just a coincidence. why is the scientific community so closed off to the idea of biological resonance with solar activity?",
